A cautious reconstruction is: $O_{\mathrm{sustained}}
\sim
E_{\mathrm{work}}\cdot C_{\mathrm{maintained}},$ where $O_{\mathrm{sustained}}$ is durable output, $E_{\mathrm{work}}$ is direct work effort, and $C_{\mathrm{maintained}}$ is maintained personal capacity. The equation is not in the interview. It keeps the mechanism visible: effort alone is not the whole system if capacity is being spent down.

